    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but even talking about it doesn't change the reality. it's just day after day of the same thing... the hospital smells, the machines, the way he looks at me and doesn't even know who i am. it feels like i'm already buried. like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life while i wait for him to die so i can finally... i dont even know. i just feel so empty. like there is nothing left for me in this world once this is over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
