      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of that constant, unbearable reality is immense, and it makes perfect sense that you feel empty. Feeling like a ghost in your own life while waiting for something so difficult is a profound form of exhaustion. If the day-to-day is this suffocating, reaching out to a professional who can help you manage this intense emotional pain is a crucial next step. Please know that there are people who can help you find a way through this darkness, even when it feels impossible.",
